We examine the operator product expansion (OPE) blocks associated with spinning operators within the context of the AdS$_{3}$/CFT$_{2}$ correspondence. By employing the conformal partial wave decomposition, we derive the explicit form of these OPE blocks for spinning operators in the global AdS$_{3}$ geometry. Furthermore, we demonstrate that the OPE blocks for spinning operators in global AdS$_{3}$ are identical to those in the Poincar\'e patch. Finally, we establish the connection between the OPE blocks for spinning operators in global AdS$_{3}$ and the conformal blocks for spinning operators in the Poincar\'e patch.
